next_action:
  id: AR-3-START
  description_es: Iniciar Modelo de Binding definiendo seam bilateral, responsabilidades, mapeos, autoridad y criterios de conformidad.
  description_en: Start Binding Model defining bilateral seam, responsibilities, mappings, authority and conformance criteria.
  decision_target: AR-3 INITIAL MODEL

ar_3_initial_questions:
  - what a Binding owns and must never own
  - inbound and outbound mapping symmetry/asymmetry
  - identity mapping and correlation
  - capability mapping
  - loss and degradation propagation
  - domain authority preservation
  - Binding lifecycle/version compatibility
  - KOS-specific Binding vs neutral Binding interface
  - independent non-KOS Binding feasibility

reentry_rule:
  - verify actual Git HEAD before development
  - reconcile CURRENT.kscl against later commits/documents
  - do not infer authority from this record

assertions:
  - CURRENT.kscl is mutable continuity state
  - checkpoint is historical snapshot
  - KSCL continuity != architectural authority
  - KSCL reconstruction != proof
